msgstr "导入 SmokePing 配置"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The configured SmokePing file is read with the files it includes, from its own directory. An uploaded file is read on its own: @include is not allowed in it."
msgstr "已配置的 SmokePing 文件会连同其包含的文件一起，从其所在目录读取。上传的文件则单独读取：其中不允许使用 @include。"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "The configured file, %s"
msgstr "已配置的文件，%s"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "An uploaded file, without @include"
msgstr "上传的文件，不含 @include"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Uploaded File"
msgstr "上传的文件"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for an uploaded file: a SmokePing configuration of at most 4 MiB."
msgstr "仅用于上传的文件：大小不超过 4 MiB 的 SmokePing 配置。"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "设备"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host groups targets that probe the same host. A device that already has the host name on the chosen poller is used instead of a new one."
msgstr "每个 SmokePing 主机对应一个设备，会将探测同一主机的目标归为一组。如果所选轮询器上已有使用该主机名的设备，则使用该设备而不是新建设备。"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host"
msgstr "每个 SmokePing 主机一个设备"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing target"
msgstr "每个 SmokePing 目标一个设备"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Device Template"
msgstr "设备模板"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The template of devices the import creates."
msgstr "导入所创建设备使用的模板。"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "轮询器"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The poller of new devices. It must be the poller that runs the SmokePing reader, or their summary data sources get no data."
msgstr "新设备所属的轮询器。它必须是运行 SmokePing 读取器的轮询器，否则其汇总数据源将没有数据。"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Site"
msgstr "站点"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The site of new devices."
msgstr "新设备所属的站点。"

#: lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_inventory.php
